{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sylox is a short, minimalistic base-building game with a touch of worker placement. You can assign workers to key tasks, unlock new buildings, expand, and defend your growing base against increasing enemy attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871530/extras/888567d60cf73487ea534c3ade7e61c8.poster.avif?t=1756830219\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871530/extras/888567d60cf73487ea534c3ade7e61c8.webm?t=1756830219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871530/extras/888567d60cf73487ea534c3ade7e61c8.mp4?t=1756830219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build Your Base</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design and grow your base from the ground up. Place buildings to harvest resources, produce materials, and expand outwards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategically lay down defensive structures to guard your colony against threats. Every building has a purpose, from core infrastructure to actual defensive buildings. Whether you're optimizing production chains or fortifying your perimeter, smart planning is key to survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871530/extras/2cd90e57a3c9aece3cc0ebf7f4cb7c53.poster.avif?t=1756830219\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871530/extras/2cd90e57a3c9aece3cc0ebf7f4cb7c53.webm?t=1756830219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871530/extras/2cd90e57a3c9aece3cc0ebf7f4cb7c53.mp4?t=1756830219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Defend your base</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your base grows, enemies will test your defenses.\u00a0Build and position defensive structures to protect vital infrastructure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat can be both strategic and chaotic. Make sure your base is resilient enough to handle unforeseen events!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871530/extras/6147ca5d83850d14d5d32ad5260d6a49.poster.avif?t=1756830219\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871530/extras/6147ca5d83850d14d5d32ad5260d6a49.webm?t=1756830219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871530/extras/6147ca5d83850d14d5d32ad5260d6a49.mp4?t=1756830219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Research and Unlocks</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress your colony with a flexible tech tree that lets you unlock new buildings, upgrades, and systems as you grow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your path: specialize in defense, offense, or boost your economy. Each unlock brings new strategic options, letting you shape your playstyle and adapt to the challenges ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871530/extras/4c080b8fb37189d327e8d4d448eb2a6e.poster.avif?t=1756830219\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871530/extras/4c080b8fb37189d327e8d4d448eb2a6e.webm?t=1756830219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871530/extras/4c080b8fb37189d327e8d4d448eb2a6e.mp4?t=1756830219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Manage Your Workforce</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every worker counts. With a limited crew, you\u2019ll need to carefully assign tasks to keep your base running smoothly. Assign workers to construction, production, transit and defense based on what you need.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prioritize what's critical. Do you assign a worker to a gold mine or man a turret? The right call at the right time can mean the difference between growth and collapse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871530/extras/259a105d09dfa40a90921b9fa3bd599e.poster.avif?t=1756830219\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871530/extras/259a105d09dfa40a90921b9fa3bd599e.webm?t=1756830219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871530/extras/259a105d09dfa40a90921b9fa3bd599e.mp4?t=1756830219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3871530?t=1756830219","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3871530?t=1756830219","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871530/4bac5449940b3227c5cedd4e4bf69161cfa2eb70/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756830219","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871530/4bac5449940b3227c5cedd4e4bf69161cfa2eb70/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756830219","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sylox is a short, minimalistic base-building game with a touch of worker placement. You can assign workers to key tasks, unlock new buildings, expand, and defend your growing base against increasing enemy attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871530/extras/888567d60cf73487ea534c3ade7e61c8.poster.avif?t=1756830219\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871530/extras/888567d60cf73487ea534c3ade7e61c8.webm?t=1756830219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871530/extras/888567d60cf73487ea534c3ade7e61c8.mp4?t=1756830219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build Your Base</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design and grow your base from the ground up. Place buildings to harvest resources, produce materials, and expand outwards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategically lay down defensive structures to guard your colony against threats. Every building has a purpose, from core infrastructure to actual defensive buildings. Whether you're optimizing production chains or fortifying your perimeter, smart planning is key to survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871530/extras/2cd90e57a3c9aece3cc0ebf7f4cb7c53.poster.avif?t=1756830219\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871530/extras/2cd90e57a3c9aece3cc0ebf7f4cb7c53.webm?t=1756830219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871530/extras/2cd90e57a3c9aece3cc0ebf7f4cb7c53.mp4?t=1756830219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Defend your base</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your base grows, enemies will test your defenses.\u00a0Build and position defensive structures to protect vital infrastructure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat can be both strategic and chaotic. Make sure your base is resilient enough to handle unforeseen events!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871530/extras/6147ca5d83850d14d5d32ad5260d6a49.poster.avif?t=1756830219\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871530/extras/6147ca5d83850d14d5d32ad5260d6a49.webm?t=1756830219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871530/extras/6147ca5d83850d14d5d32ad5260d6a49.mp4?t=1756830219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Research and Unlocks</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress your colony with a flexible tech tree that lets you unlock new buildings, upgrades, and systems as you grow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your path: specialize in defense, offense, or boost your economy. Each unlock brings new strategic options, letting you shape your playstyle and adapt to the challenges ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871530/extras/4c080b8fb37189d327e8d4d448eb2a6e.poster.avif?t=1756830219\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871530/extras/4c080b8fb37189d327e8d4d448eb2a6e.webm?t=1756830219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871530/extras/4c080b8fb37189d327e8d4d448eb2a6e.mp4?t=1756830219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Manage Your Workforce</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every worker counts. With a limited crew, you\u2019ll need to carefully assign tasks to keep your base running smoothly. Assign workers to construction, production, transit and defense based on what you need.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prioritize what's critical. Do you assign a worker to a gold mine or man a turret? The right call at the right time can mean the difference between growth and collapse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871530/extras/259a105d09dfa40a90921b9fa3bd599e.poster.avif?t=1756830219\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871530/extras/259a105d09dfa40a90921b9fa3bd599e.webm?t=1756830219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871530/extras/259a105d09dfa40a90921b9fa3bd599e.mp4?t=1756830219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Moonz"],"genres":[{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871530/663e8d9e0e355219f603c90e995128e6803563db/header.jpg?t=1756830219","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3871530/1451004517/5a746e4feff607a1351a8f473f5f81b5d8ca0f23/1755344757/dash_av1.mpd?t=1755346415","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/